  "content": "<p>史诗骑士：冰与火是<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士</a>模组激动人心的扩展，将其与<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ice-and-fire-dragons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">冰与火</a>模组完美融合。该扩展为玩家提供了20种新武器类型，采用14种来自冰与火的材料打造，每种武器都拥有独特特效。</p><p>本项目需要安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/epic-knights-armor-and-weapons\" rel=\"nofollow\">史诗骑士</a>模组及其所有依赖项。大部分材质由StaxiHD创作。</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1030/206/weapons.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"700\" height=\"591\"></p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
